{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29045","headline":"早发天台中岩寺度关岭次天姥岑 · 许浑","name":"早发天台中岩寺度关岭次天姥岑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来往天台天姥间，欲求真诀驻衰颜。\n星河半落岩前寺，云雾初开岭上关。\n丹壑树多风浩浩，碧溪苔浅水潺潺。\n可知刘阮逢人处，行尽深山又是山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}